n...\n- wie das Publikum sich zusammensetzt\n- wie lange der Vortrag maximal sein darf (mit Stoppuhr)\n- wie Aufmerksam das Publikum zuh\u00f6rt\n\nIm Nachgang kannst Du dir nochmal anschauen und anh\u00f6ren, wie gut Du dich geschlagen hast.\n\nDie aktuellen R\u00e4ume sind:\n- Konferenzraum mit 3 Personen (Bewerbungsgespr\u00e4ch)\n- Seminarraum"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ImpLandscape.png", "id": "2476178992540280", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65398055_2476178995873613_5890563130306836643_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IyMdB0UUjqcQ7kNvwHLxhDQ&_nc_oc=AdrxZ3MOzO1KHup7V9V0IlmFTWNTdU3tU-URdsRmkm-ICf4dWQoronjiUfTd75ZDVFU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKtjEdeD2oZjYWANbySRyMLhSe_QVIoQ1X08lt_Ll7DoQ&oe=6AA939C7"}, {"file_name": "ImpCover.png", "id": "2401543720011882", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575350_2401543723345215_1378399666035813534_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=edqIgDTiyxkQ7kNvwF10UUR&_nc_oc=AdqKmnpnooF1QksXzCHqa215TuN9xfo1H19wYz9Ht7M3MWyoYd1ZmpDTmNq-jMMFEEI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK-69He57qQNpcqW25Pbq_YaiRWKF4sd5m_zoNyiP4bjA&oe=6AA9477C"}, {"file_name": "ImpHero.png", "id": "1575384222929044", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974551_1575384226262377_3077729185527084450_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sy6jNxxi6fcQ7kNvwF0G5yl&_nc_oc=AdouHSShg9W7YeimeFlMIyexfeBw9JPK5dpEMmNQo_6UblhI8Li3oig0D1HqCrrkDVQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKi917Gh2ZewJnK5eZykTGjmT1SuLQY7EsUHDoeWKmfHw&oe=6AA938AB"}, {"file_name": "Basic ohne Claim (3).png", "id": "1408933533196382", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974709_1408933536529715_446